---@class tencentcloud.keewidb.Options
---@field secret_id? string required: the SecretId of the API key; default from TENCENTCLOUD_SECRET_ID
---@field secret_key? string|distilled.Secret|fun(host: table): (string|distilled.Secret|nil, distilled.Error?) required secret: a string, a secret, or fn(host) -> value, err; default from TENCENTCLOUD_SECRET_KEY
---@field session_token? string|distilled.Secret|fun(host: table): (string|distilled.Secret|nil, distilled.Error?) secret: the session token of temporary (STS) credentials, sent as X-TC-Token; default from TENCENTCLOUD_SESSION_TOKEN
---@field region? string default region (X-TC-Region) for calls whose input sets no region; default from TENCENTCLOUD_REGION; none: no header (products that are not regional)
---@field root_domain? string the domain API hosts live under, default tencentcloudapi.com
---@field endpoint? string a URL that replaces https://<service>.<root_domain> (a proxy, a test server); {service} in it is the product's service name. The signed host is its host
---@field host? table The host seams: transport, sleep, now, exec, random, getenv, epoch
---@field transport? fun(request: table): (table?, distilled.Error?)
---@field sleep? fun(seconds: number)
---@field now? fun(): number
---@field retry? string|table A retry preset or policy fields
---@field deadline_s? number Wall-clock budget for one call, sleeps included
---@field tracing? "off"|"operation"|"debug"|table
---@field validation? "lenient"|"additional"|"strict"
---@field [string] any

